    },
    {
      "from": "service",
      "to": "records",
      "message": "核品牌/租户/分类及当前/历史范围；配置共享不授全品牌数据权",
      "type": "request",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": null,
      "source_step_refs": [
        2
      ],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [],
      "step": 3
    },
    {
      "from": "service",
      "to": "ui",
      "message": "返回原有权筛选范围，不要求本人坐席/双模块，不授代处理",
      "type": "response",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": "查看范围可核",
      "source_step_refs": [
        2
      ],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [],
      "step": 4
    },
    {
      "from": "person",
      "to": "ui",
      "message": "按有权范围筛选分类、租户或导入批次并查询。",
      "type": "request",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": null,
      "source_step_refs": [
        3
      ],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [],
      "step": 5
    },
    {
      "from": "ui",
      "to": "service",
      "message": "按原筛选请求同一台账/批次结果",
      "type": "request",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": null,
      "source_step_refs": [
        3
      ],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [],
      "step": 6
    },
    {
      "from": "service",
      "to": "records",
      "message": "读取同一台账和有权批次，区分新模型和存量。；读取同一原台账及有权批次；新模型按BASE/ROUTE/单模板和各字段定义/选项/结果快照区分，存量仍原查询和原处理，不补建实例或迁移。读取失败/关联待核不以空态代替。",
      "type": "request",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": null,
      "source_step_refs": [
        4
      ],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [],
      "step": 7
    },
    {
      "from": "records",
      "to": "service",
      "message": "返回本次可核查询结果，可以是真实空结果",
      "type": "response",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": "读取可靠",
      "source_step_refs": [
        4
      ],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [],
      "step": 8
    },
    {
      "from": "service",
      "to": "ui",
      "message": "展示本次有权原列表及定位；无记录走真实空态，不复制业务表",
      "type": "response",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": "本次查询可靠",
      "source_step_refs": [
        5
      ],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [],
      "step": 9
    },
    {
      "from": "person",
      "to": "ui",
      "message": "选择一条记录打开详情",
      "type": "request",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": "有本次有权记录",
      "source_step_refs": [
        5
      ],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [],
      "step": 10
    },
    {
      "from": "ui",
      "to": "service",
      "message": "详情再次鉴权并核当前归属/截止和固定版本",
      "type": "request",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": null,
      "source_step_refs": [
        6
      ],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [],
      "step": 11
    },
    {
      "from": "service",
      "to": "records",
      "message": "按本次可见范围读取原定义/选项/值与真实轨迹，不露下游当前字段或录音",
      "type": "request",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": null,
      "source_step_refs": [
        6
      ],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [],
      "step": 12
    },
    {
      "from": "records",
      "to": "service",
      "message": "仅返回可靠范围内的固定快照及事实，原精确关联/权限未核则待核",
      "type": "response",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": "详情范围及读取可靠",
      "source_step_refs": [
        6
      ],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [],
      "step": 13
    },
    {
      "from": "service",
      "to": "ui",
      "message": "只读监管当前授权品牌/租户交集内的同一记录和真实轨迹；展示固定单模板、分类字段、意向/人工指派/目标状态，逐路径依据仅在实际可见范围内。不代HQ管理员选店，不启动/分配/转交/补录，不扩大源录音、存量或截止历史范围。",
      "type": "response",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": "本次有权详情可靠",
      "source_step_refs": [
        6
      ],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [],
      "step": 14
    },
    {
      "from": "ui",
      "to": "person",
      "message": "本次监管只读，无分配/启动/转交/选店/补录入口",
      "type": "response",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": "本次详情展示完成",
      "source_step_refs": [
        6
      ],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [],
      "step": 15
    },
    {
      "from": "service",
      "to": "ui",
      "message": "拒绝访问，不能跨范围泄露记录。",
      "type": "response",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": "[ALT-2034-DENY] 无权查询或伪造直接链接",
      "source_step_refs": [],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [
        "ALT-2034-DENY"
      ],
      "step": 16
    },
    {
      "from": "service",
      "to": "ui",
      "message": "显示失败/待核，不把读取失败展示成没有记录。",
      "type": "response",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": "[ALT-2034-READ] 读取失败或结果待核",
      "source_step_refs": [],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [
        "ALT-2034-READ"
      ],
      "step": 17
    },
    {
      "from": "service",
      "to": "ui",
      "message": "展示真实空状态，可调整条件另次查询。",
      "type": "response",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": "[ALT-2034-EMPTY] 成功查询但没有匹配记录",
      "source_step_refs": [],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [
        "ALT-2034-EMPTY"
      ],
      "step": 18
    },
    {
      "from": "service",
      "to": "ui",
      "message": "详情再次鉴权和读取，不展示旧缓存冒充有权当前详情。；详情打开时再次核范围、当前身份及原快照；失权或无法可靠读取不展示过期缓存，不依品牌共用推全品牌权。",
      "type": "response",
      "api_id": null,
      "condition": "[ALT-2034-DETAIL] 打开详情时资格变化或读取失败",
      "source_step_refs": [],
      "covered_alternate_flow_ids": [
        "ALT-2034-DETAIL"
      ],
